      "name": "Sites Skyatp",
      "description": {
        "content": "SkyATP is a cloud-based solution that provides advanced threat protection for network security.\n\nIt allows security analysts to update their defense against new attack techniques in real-time and distribute threat intelligence quickly.\n\nSkyATP inspects network traffic and blocks devices that have downloaded malware or accessed command and control servers. It also offers configuration and troubleshooting capabilities for administrators.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
